# Cloud Build upload context. Without this file gcloud falls back to
# .gitignore, which excludes public/tesseract/* -- the vendored OCR wasm and
# language data. The Dockerfile regenerates them with `pnpm vendor:ocr`, so
# excluding them is correct AND keeps the upload small, but relying on a
# fallback for something load-bearing is how it silently changes later.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.next
out
documents
test-docs
.claude
.superpowers
public/tesseract
*.log
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
